The best armor setup, based on mine own experience:

Hawaiian shirt (+ whatever)
Gray dragon mail (magic resistance)
Speed boots (2X speed)
Helm of brilliance (+4 or 5 to help with spells)
    (Helm of telepathy could also be useful; I say its a toss-up)
Gauntlets of Dexterity (increase to hit)
Cloak of Displacment (reduce hits on you)

My assumptions for the above list:

Str 18/** can be attained intrinsically, is better than str 25
Stealth intrinsic can be attained after ALOT of sacrifices and  
prayers
Invisibility can be gotten from stalker

